id: saiba-type
name: Saiba-Type
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Traits and never enforced (the user's). Its Factor Traits: Recolored Saibaman 1,
# Copyman 2, Saibabrute 3.
requirement: >
  Saibamen
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Engineered, adapted, or grown in unusual soil, you’ve become unusual in some way compared to your Saiba-brethren.
